.TH "dbxtool" "1" "" 2.1.7 "dbxtool man page"
.hy
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
\f[B]dbxtool\f[R] \- modify the dbx revocation list 
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\f[B]dbxtool\f[R] [CMD] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This manual page documents briefly the \f[B]dbxtool\f[R] command.  
.PP
\f[B]dbxtool\f[R] allows a user to operate on the UEFI dbx revocation list.  This tool can be used to list the current dbx contents or update it to a newer version.  
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
The dbxtool command takes various options depending on the action.  Run \f[B]dbxtool --help\f[R] for the full list.  
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.PP
See GitHub Issues: <https://github.com/fwupd/fwupd/issues> 
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
<fwupdtool(1)> <fwupdmgr(1)> 